  "description": "TableReader.ExcelDataReader is a .NET 8 library designed for reading tabular data from Excel files in a simple and efficient manner.\nIt provides an intuitive API to extract tables, rows, and columns from specified worksheets, supporting flexible range selection and robust error handling.\nBuilt on top of the widely-used ExcelDataReader library, this package is ideal for applications that require reliable Excel data import functionality without relying on Microsoft Office interop.\nTableReader.ExcelDataReader is well-suited for modern .NET applications and services that need to process Excel data quickly and safely.",
